Splitwise

(a) 
Clarify Requirements

Users should be able to create groups and add expenses among group members.
Let's assume : Equal split , Exact amount split , Percentage split

Users can see their balances.
Users can settle debts.
Expenses can exist within a group.
We need to validate that the split amounts add up to the expense amount.

Users can create expenses, split them using different strategies, track balances, 
view who owes whom, and settle debts.

(b) 
Identify the core entities

User
Expense
Split
Group
Balance
SplitStrategy <- EqualSplit , ExactSplit , PercentageSplit


User
